{"logId": "a0629b64-2b28-43b2-a7f3-d4e5a2fc2e70", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、员工：本人年度内任意选择参评模块进行自评，小组成员复核成绩，复核通过则得分；复核有异议，提交至课长复核，以课长复核成绩为准。处长及店长对所辖部门考核成绩的合理、科学、准确起关键性的指导和把控作用。", "block_bbox": [195, 140, 1009, 219], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[195.0, 140.0], [1009.0, 140.0], [1009.0, 219.0], [195.0, 219.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、管理层：管理层进行自评，小组成员复核成绩，复核通过则得分；复核有异议，提交部门第一主管复核，以部门第一主管复核成绩为准。", "block_bbox": [198, 225, 1013, 276], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 225.0], [1013.0, 225.0], [1013.0, 276.0], [198.0, 276.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、业态第一主管：本人进行自评，小组成员复核成绩，复核通过则得分；复核有异议，提交值班经理及文化部复核，以值班经理及文化部复核为准。", "block_bbox": [197, 281, 1014, 332], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 281.0], [1014.0, 281.0], [1014.0, 332.0], [197.0, 332.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "打分规则", "block_bbox": [166, 348, 266, 374], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[166.0, 348.0], [266.0, 348.0], [266.0, 374.0], [166.0, 374.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、考核等级由低到高，践行程度和生活状态越好，分值越高", "block_bbox": [196, 384, 681, 406], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[196.0, 384.0], [681.0, 384.0], [681.0, 406.0], [196.0, 406.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、每个模块有五个进阶等级，每个等级分别对照相应的分值；保证做到较低等级的全部条款，才能进阶到较高等级", "block_bbox": [195, 413, 1010, 462], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[195.0, 413.0], [1010.0, 413.0], [1010.0, 462.0], [195.0, 462.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、每个等级内设置半分，全部做到得全分、 $ \\geq $50%做到可得半分、<50%不得分", "block_bbox": [196, 469, 843, 491], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[196.0, 469.0], [837.0, 469.0], [837.0, 490.0], [196.0, 490.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、加分项目不纳入等级必须标准，若有符合行为则可按照标准进行加分", "block_bbox": [196, 497, 772, 519], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[196.0, 497.0], [766.0, 497.0], [766.0, 518.0], [196.0, 518.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、建议项不计入考评得分", "block_bbox": [197, 525, 410, 547], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 525.0], [410.0, 525.0], [410.0, 547.0], [197.0, 547.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、1分以下或3分以上（不含1分和3分），需上级主管根据细则进行核实，并书写评估", "block_bbox": [198, 552, 918, 575], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 552.0], [882.0, 552.0], [882.0, 574.0], [198.0, 574.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、日常生活及工作中发现违反各模块底线原则（1分）中的任意一项行为，得0分", "block_bbox": [195, 581, 843, 604], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[195.0, 581.0], [843.0, 581.0], [843.0, 604.0], [195.0, 604.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "8、有人举证违反各模块底线原则（1分）中的任意一项，调查属实，得0分", "block_bbox": [196, 609, 789, 632], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[196.0, 609.0], [789.0, 609.0], [789.0, 632.0], [196.0, 632.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "9、考评通过申请等级分数，若年度内发现不符合行为，降至相应符合分数", "block_bbox": [195, 638, 789, 660], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[195.0, 638.0], [789.0, 638.0], [789.0, 660.0], [195.0, 660.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "10、如果对评分有异议，可逐级提交复核或直接向公司后勤申请复核", "block_bbox": [194, 667, 743, 688], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[194.0, 667.0], [743.0, 667.0], [743.0, 688.0], [194.0, 688.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[16]", "block_bbox": [574, 718, 611, 737], "block_id": 14, "block_order": null, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[574.0, 718.0], [610.0, 718.0], [610.0, 736.0], [574.0, 736.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评制度", "block_bbox": [202, 900, 303, 927], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[202.0, 900.0], [303.0, 900.0], [303.0, 927.0], [202.0, 927.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、低于1分，限期整改（6个月内自主申请复核，年度内首次复核成绩可作为年度有效成绩）", "block_bbox": [231, 975, 961, 1000], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[231.0, 975.0], [961.0, 975.0], [961.0, 1000.0], [231.0, 1000.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、管理层低于2分，限期整改（6个月内复核，仍不合格取消管理资格）", "block_bbox": [231, 1008, 803, 1032], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[231.0, 1008.0], [803.0, 1008.0], [803.0, 1032.0], [231.0, 1032.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、低于2分，当年无竞聘资格", "block_bbox": [232, 1041, 480, 1064], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[232.0, 1041.0], [480.0, 1041.0], [480.0, 1064.0], [232.0, 1064.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、处理制度：违反以下条例，按照《幸福生命状态考评奖励方案》进行相应处理", "block_bbox": [232, 1073, 882, 1097], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[232.0, 1073.0], [882.0, 1073.0], [882.0, 1097.0], [232.0, 1097.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）自我评估不真实、不真诚，明知存在不达标情况，申请高于践行程度的达标奖励", "block_bbox": [242, 1105, 916, 1130], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[242.0, 1105.0], [916.0, 1105.0], [916.0, 1130.0], [242.0, 1130.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）小组复核或主管复核时，不公平公正，对他人带私心和偏见而恶意评分", "block_bbox": [244, 1138, 846, 1162], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[244.0, 1138.0], [846.0, 1138.0], [846.0, 1162.0], [244.0, 1162.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）小组内部团体作假、敷衍对待、互相包庇，违背考核要求", "block_bbox": [243, 1171, 740, 1195], "block_id": 22, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[243.0, 1171.0], [740.0, 1171.0], [740.0, 1195.0], [243.0, 1195.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[17]", "block_bbox": [611, 1477, 650, 1498], "block_id": 23, "block_order": null, "group_id": 23, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9351356029510498, "coordinate": [195, 140, 1009, 219], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[195.0, 140.0], [1009.0, 140.0], [1009.0, 219.0], [195.0, 219.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9188721179962158, "coordinate": [198, 225, 1013, 276], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 225.0], [1013.0, 225.0], [1013.0, 276.0], [198.0, 276.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9084491729736328, "coordinate": [197, 281, 1014, 332], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 281.0], [1014.0, 281.0], [1014.0, 332.0], [197.0, 332.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8502941727638245, "coordinate": [166, 348, 266, 374], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[166.0, 348.0], [266.0, 348.0], [266.0, 374.0], [166.0, 374.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7756554484367371, "coordinate": [196, 384, 681, 406], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[196.0, 384.0], [681.0, 384.0], [681.0, 406.0], [196.0, 406.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8922809362411499, "coordinate": [195, 413, 1010, 462], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[195.0, 413.0], [1010.0, 413.0], [1010.0, 462.0], [195.0, 46